| CLI `--tools` parsing (comma split) | `/opt/.../dist/cli/args.js:85-92` |
| `getAllTools()` on extension context | `/opt/.../dist/core/extensions/types.d.ts:919` |
| `ToolInfo` type (`.name`) | `/opt/.../dist/core/extensions/types.d.ts:1096` |
